# pii-guard identifier digests: sha256("pii-guard/v1:" + lowercase identifier), one per line, then a label.
# Digests only, never values: this file can confirm a guess but cannot reveal an identifier.
# Add one (the value goes through stdin, never into a file or your shell history):
#   python3 .github/scripts/pii_guard.py --hash   # paste the identifier, then Ctrl-D
# Labels say WHAT KIND of identifier a digest is, never which one.
